    "name": "Venice After Dark",
    "steam_appid": 1933960,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933960/extras/39895a72290ae6387b90a0726dfb55dd.poster.avif?t=1743012929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933960/extras/39895a72290ae6387b90a0726dfb55dd.webm?t=1743012929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933960/extras/39895a72290ae6387b90a0726dfb55dd.mp4?t=1743012929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet Aiko, a Japanese IT engineer who is burned out and fed up with her life. She decides to take a break and travel to Venice, the city of romance and mystery. There, she is accompanied by Thea, a quirky AI that she created and considers her best friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But soon, they stumble upon a dark secret that involves the previous owner of Aiko's hotel and a haunted old mill. As Aiko investigates the mystery, she starts to have terrifying nightmares that blur the line between reality and fantasy. Can she trust her own senses and logic, or is there something more sinister at play? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933960/extras/be7b3914b0af4905294870dc0e2f8ec8.poster.avif?t=1743012929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933960/extras/be7b3914b0af4905294870dc0e2f8ec8.webm?t=1743012929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933960/extras/be7b3914b0af4905294870dc0e2f8ec8.mp4?t=1743012929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this thrilling visual novel adventure game, you will explore Venice from a new perspective and discover what it means to be human through the eyes of an AI programmer. You will face challenging puzzles, sensory illusions, and unexpected plot twists that will keep you on the edge of your seat. Are you ready to enter the world of Venice after Dark?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933960/extras/195b09d49c205cd0ec5d0cd49b2d3299.poster.avif?t=1743012929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933960/extras/195b09d49c205cd0ec5d0cd49b2d3299.webm?t=1743012929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933960/extras/195b09d49c205cd0ec5d0cd49b2d3299.mp4?t=1743012929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic <strong>Point'n'Click visual novel game</strong> in a mystery crime setting with amazing handanimated scene and animations </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exciting <strong>day and night gameplay loop</strong>: Collect informations during daytime by traveling, talking to people, collecting items and solving puzzles. Master cunning auditive and optical illusions during the nighttime </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High-Quality <strong>audio</strong> with complete soundtrack and all characters fully voiced-over </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique <strong>sensory gameplay</strong> in which the game tests your sensory abilities based on true scientific experiments </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compelling <strong>logic puzzles</strong> like hacking an elevator, X-raying secret spots or piecing together important clues</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933960/extras/792737aacfab23cca9eacd7f91237426.poster.avif?t=1743012929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933960/extras/792737aacfab23cca9eacd7f91237426.webm?t=1743012929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933960/extras/792737aacfab23cca9eacd7f91237426.mp4?t=1743012929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thrilling <strong>fact-fiction storyline</strong> including real places in Venice and real historical figures and events </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three <strong>different endings</strong> according to your decision in the storyline </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Including <strong>dynamic weather</strong> to experience Venice during sunny days, beautiful evenings, dark nights or even heavy storms </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Homorous <strong>dialogue puzzles</strong> and over 10 full-fledged NPCs to discover</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Can you unravel the mystery of the Molino Stucky mill?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Our funding partners</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933960/extras/6cfcc49711f7969552af49ddba8d5436.avif?t=1743012929\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933960/extras/39895a72290ae6387b90a0726dfb55dd.poster.avif?t=1743012929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933960/extras/39895a72290ae6387b90a0726dfb55dd.webm?t=1743012929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933960/extras/39895a72290ae6387b90a0726dfb55dd.mp4?t=1743012929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet Aiko, a Japanese IT engineer who is burned out and fed up with her life. She decides to take a break and travel to Venice, the city of romance and mystery. There, she is accompanied by Thea, a quirky AI that she created and considers her best friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But soon, they stumble upon a dark secret that involves the previous owner of Aiko's hotel and a haunted old mill. As Aiko investigates the mystery, she starts to have terrifying nightmares that blur the line between reality and fantasy. Can she trust her own senses and logic, or is there something more sinister at play? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933960/extras/be7b3914b0af4905294870dc0e2f8ec8.poster.avif?t=1743012929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933960/extras/be7b3914b0af4905294870dc0e2f8ec8.webm?t=1743012929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933960/extras/be7b3914b0af4905294870dc0e2f8ec8.mp4?t=1743012929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this thrilling visual novel adventure game, you will explore Venice from a new perspective and discover what it means to be human through the eyes of an AI programmer. You will face challenging puzzles, sensory illusions, and unexpected plot twists that will keep you on the edge of your seat. Are you ready to enter the world of Venice after Dark?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933960/extras/195b09d49c205cd0ec5d0cd49b2d3299.poster.avif?t=1743012929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933960/extras/195b09d49c205cd0ec5d0cd49b2d3299.webm?t=1743012929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933960/extras/195b09d49c205cd0ec5d0cd49b2d3299.mp4?t=1743012929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic <strong>Point'n'Click visual novel game</strong> in a mystery crime setting with amazing handanimated scene and animations </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exciting <strong>day and night gameplay loop</strong>: Collect informations during daytime by traveling, talking to people, collecting items and solving puzzles. Master cunning auditive and optical illusions during the nighttime </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High-Quality <strong>audio</strong> with complete soundtrack and all characters fully voiced-over </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique <strong>sensory gameplay</strong> in which the game tests your sensory abilities based on true scientific experiments </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compelling <strong>logic puzzles</strong> like hacking an elevator, X-raying secret spots or piecing together important clues</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933960/extras/792737aacfab23cca9eacd7f91237426.poster.avif?t=1743012929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933960/extras/792737aacfab23cca9eacd7f91237426.webm?t=1743012929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933960/extras/792737aacfab23cca9eacd7f91237426.mp4?t=1743012929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thrilling <strong>fact-fiction storyline</strong> including real places in Venice and real historical figures and events </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three <strong>different endings</strong> according to your decision in the storyline </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Including <strong>dynamic weather</strong> to experience Venice during sunny days, beautiful evenings, dark nights or even heavy storms </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Homorous <strong>dialogue puzzles</strong> and over 10 full-fledged NPCs to discover</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Can you unravel the mystery of the Molino Stucky mill?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Our funding partners</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933960/extras/6cfcc49711f7969552af49ddba8d5436.avif?t=1743012929\" /></div></p>",
    "short_description": "A short break in Venice turns into a dangerous adventure! And the mysterious history of a surreal mill becomes a surreal test of existence...Solve the mysterious case around the Stucky family and unravel what it means to be human through the eyes of an AI programmer.",
